Writes a push-to-deploy GitHub Actions workflow for a prepared Linux runner with Docker, Rust, lk, `OpenTofu`, Kamal, and an SSH agent

Usage: leptoskit infra ci [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --app-target <NAME>  Select a named target from the root leptoskit.toml
      --force              
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version
